            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TxCin2"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I scaled this down to a quarter but still used 1 avocado. It came out just the right mix of everything that way. If I had made the whole batch I would definitely have added in 3 more avocados to balance out the cheese/sour cream. I thought it was still missing something though so I added in some garlic salt and that was just what it needed. I serve this over a bed of shredded lettuce with tortilla chips and garnished with cilantro. This was really good, thanks.",
            "datePublished": "2011-05-15T11:08:53.137Z"
          },
